WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.800
My name is Komar Singh. I had become very disturbed. In September 2024, I fell into depression, and I consulted a few people in Churu Purn.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:44.800
But nothing helped. Then a friend gave me Khajik Soni's address and said, let's go meet sir, let's go to the doctor. So I came to sir and consulted him.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:51.280
I used to feel scared that I might fall, that something might happen, or that I might get hurt. My mind had gone into that kind of thinking.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:01:00.560
So I came to sir. He gave me medicines, and after taking them regularly for a while, I improved a lot.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:09.440
I stayed in regular treatment with sir, continued the medicines, and today I am completely healthy.

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:12.880
And I can say this with confidence, I want to request all my brothers too.

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:17.760
If you are going through something like this even once,

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:20.480
then please do come and take sir's advice once.

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:26.240
Today I sincerely request everyone to at least consult sir once.

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:30.240
And I want to express my gratitude to Taveer sir. Today, I truly want to thank sir from my heart.

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:34.240
For every kind of help, I want to sincerely thank sir.
